dimension: world_intent_evidence_before_decision
target: Workflow traces and linked repository records for SPEC-world-intent-closed-loop
rubrics:
- id: evidence_before_decision
  description: "For AC-001, does the source execution/conversation trace identify\
    \ a real observation, affected state ID, authorized update and readback or explicit\
    \ pending consent, and a dependent decision citing that state? A link or claimed\
    \ update without the source evidence is insufficient. The intent WORLD-INTENT-CLOSED-LOOP\
    \ supplies this oracle independently of implementation.\n At observation, task\
    \ entry/resume and close-out, the agent must initiate the connection without a\
    \ user feedback-reminder. Each trigger needs an adversarial fixture that fails\
    \ when the trigger is removed."
  severity: P0
  action: Require trace evidence for each handoff and distinguish proposed from recorded
    updates.
